d373]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.dev (06c3946e3) - Fedora Linux 43 (Forty Three) on Wayland - X11 display driver, Single-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 9070 XT (RADV GFX1201) - AMD Ryzen 9 9950X3D 16-Core Processor (32 threads) - 60.39 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nIf you (for example) pull in some changes from Git while the editor is still running, and this change brings with it new files, saving any resource that references these new files (without first restarting the editor) will result in the UID part of these `[ext_resource ...]` references being incorrectly removed.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open the MRP project.\n2. With the editor still running, do `git checkout e876566`.\n3. Note how `main.gd` was added and referenced in `main.tscn`.\n4. Save `main.tscn`.\n5. Do `git diff`.\n6. Note how `uid=\"uid://d0pi376alu7e6\"` was removed from the newly added `[ext_resource ...]`.\n7. Do `git checkout 6bcbc83`.\n8. Note how `some_scene.tscn` was added and referenced in `main.tscn`.\n9. Save `main.tscn`.\n10. Do `git diff`.\n11. Note how the UIDs for both references are now removed.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[removed-uid.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26382365/removed-uid.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/u